\f2\fs26 \cf0 \{\
  "origin": "BLR",\
  "destination": "LHR",\
  "passengers": \{\
    "adult": 2\
  \}\
\}\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 For 
\f2\fs26 a2a-wrapper
\f0\fs24 , this is especially useful because the underlying agent doesn't have to be an LLM.\
You could wrap:\
