\f0\fs24 \cf0 or inline bytes depending on the binding.\
The current conceptual model defines parts around text, raw bytes, URLs and structured data. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://a2a-protocol.org/latest/topics/key-concepts/?utm_source=chatgpt.com"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 A2A Protocol}}\
