\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 A2A adds another abstraction: Work\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Suppose you tell an agent:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Analyse my application architecture, inspect 20 repositories, check dependencies, identify security issues and generate a report.\
This isn't really just:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 message 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f2  message\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 There is something happening independently:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0                      Task\
                       
\f3 \uc0\u9474 
\f2 \
                "Architecture Review"\
                       
\f3 \uc0\u9474 
\f2 \
             
\f3 \uc0\u9484 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9524 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9488 
\f2 \
             
\f3 \uc0\u9474 
\f2                    
\f3 \uc0\u9474 
\f2 \
          status              outputs\
             
\f3 \uc0\u9474 
\f2                    
\f3 \uc0\u9474 
\f2 \
         WORKING              report.md\
             
\f3 \uc0\u9474 
\f2                 findings.json\
             
\f3 \uc0\u9474 
\f2 \
        COMPLETED\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 That object is the 
\f1\b Task
\f0\b0 .\
The client can now ask:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 What is the status?\
What outputs have been produced?\
Does the agent need more information?\
Can I cancel it?\
Can I reconnect to it?\
Can I subscribe to updates?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 That's the key difference. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://a2a-protocol.org/dev/specification/?utm_source=chatgpt.com"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 A2A Protocol}}\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
